/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 84 0 R
/E (TastyBites is a food delivery platform operating across multiple cities and offering a wide range of food and beverage products. While the company has experienced strong sales growth, management has observed that not all products contribute equally to profitability. Some products generate high revenue but deliver low profit margins, while others contribute significantly to overall profit despite lower sales volumes.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
