107 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 84 0 R
/E (The company currently lacks visibility into which products and categories are driving profitability. Excessive discounting and inconsistent pricing strategies may be reducing profit margins without generating proportional increases in sales.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
